    "wp.cover.statusLive": "Testnet Live",
    "wp.cover.sub": "A verification and custody layer for tokenized real-world assets, built on a dedicated Layer&nbsp;3 network.",
    "wp.dex.h2": "A Single Markets Layer",
    "wp.dex.kicker": "&sect;05 &middot; Sectora DEX",
    "wp.dex.p1": "The <a class=\"wp-inline-link\" href=\"/dex-cover.html\">Sectora DEX</a> is the network's markets layer: a single venue to trade, swap, and go P2P across live-quoted crypto, tokenized metals, and index-tracked assets. Rather than isolating tokenized real-world assets in a separate venue from native crypto pairs, Sectora settles both through the same custody-verified infrastructure, with every price refreshed in real time.",
    "wp.dex.p2": "Because tokenized assets on Sectora carry a live, verifiable custody record, the DEX can list them alongside crypto pairs without asking traders to trust a separate, off-chain attestation.",
    "wp.footer.copy": "&copy; 2026 Sectora Foundation IL. All rights reserved. This whitepaper is a living document and may be revised as the protocol develops.",
