    "wp.supply.kicker": "&sect;08 &middot; Supply &amp; Buyback",
    "wp.supply.p1": "Sectora's supply policy is deliberately conservative: rather than an open-ended emission schedule, the network commits to a one-time <strong>Strategic Supply Reduction in December 2026</strong>, cutting total supply by 50% &mdash; from 50,000,000 to 25,000,000 $SECT &mdash; to align circulating supply with actual network usage rather than a fixed issuance curve decided in advance.",
    "wp.supply.p2": "The <strong>Buyback Engine</strong> reinforces that alignment on an ongoing basis: a share of network fee revenue generated by validators flows into a buyback pool, which purchases $SECT on the open market. Token scarcity is therefore a function of network activity &mdash; validators, custody volume, and DEX usage &mdash; rather than speculative demand alone.",
